Package: com.local.notesexporter
Name: NotesExporter
Version: 1.1.0
Architecture: iphoneos-arm
Description: Export Apple Notes as JSON through TrollFools
 Supports single-note and selected-note batch export with the system share sheet.
 Primarily developed and tested on iOS 17.0; minimum deployment target is iOS 15.0.
Maintainer: local
Author: local
Section: Tweaks
Depends: firmware (>= 15.0)
